{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "fm-mobile-2026-10-21",
    "name": "FacilityManagement - Mobile APIs",
    "description": "Complete booking-related API surface for the Mobile team.\n\n## Setup\n1. Import this collection into Postman.\n2. Open the collection → Variables tab.\n3. Set `base_url` to your backend host (e.g. `http://localhost:3000` or `https://api.yourcompany.com`).\n4. Run **Auth → Login** first — it auto-saves the JWT to `{{token}}`.\n5. All other requests use that token automatically via collection-level Bearer auth.\n\n## Groups\n- **1. Auth** — login/logout/me/forgot/reset\n- **2. Pickers** — sites, buildings, floors, facilities, operating hours (populate booking form dropdowns)\n- **3. Bookings** — list / check availability / create / cancel / reschedule\n- **4. Approvals** — manager inbox + approve/reject\n- **5. QR Public** — scan-based check-in / check-out (no auth)\n- **6. Ratings** — post-booking feedback\n- **7. Extras** — departments, pantries\n\n## Response envelope\n```json\n{ \"status\": true,  \"data\": { ... } }   // success\n{ \"status\": false, \"msg\": \"...\" }       // error (plus HTTP 4xx/5xx)\n```\n\n## Gotchas\n- `to_date` is EXCLUSIVE in list filters (query 'today' uses `from=today, to=tomorrow`).\n- Date format: `YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS` (24-hour, server timezone).\n- `start_at` must be in the future on create.\n- Always pre-check availability via `GET /bookings/day` or `GET /bookings/check` before `POST /bookings`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:3000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "handoff_token", "value": "", "type": "string", "description": "Paste the Embassy-minted handoff JWT here before running 'Exchange handoff for FMS token'." },
    { "key": "facility_id", "value": "86", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "booking_id", "value": "506", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "site_id", "value": "3", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "today", "value": "2026-10-21", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tomorrow", "value": "2026-10-22", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Auto-save token to collection variable for subsequent requests",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.status && json.data && json.data.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.data.token);",
                  "    console.log('✓ Token saved to {{token}}');",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin@umbrella.local\",\n  \"password\": \"your-password\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Returns `{ token, user }`. Rate limit: 10 attempts / 15 min / IP.\n\nResponse shape:\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"token\": \"eyJhbGc...\",\n    \"user\": {\n      \"id\": 42, \"name\": \"Rohit\", \"lname\": \"Pandey\",\n      \"email\": \"...\", \"username\": \"...\",\n      \"role\": \"employee\",\n      \"tenant_id\": 5, \"organisation_id\": 5,\n      \"department_id\": 3, \"is_approver\": 0\n    }\n  }\n}\n```"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Me (current user)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Returns the logged-in user profile. Use on app launch to verify token is still valid."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "logout"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Forgot password",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/forgot-password",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "forgot-password"]
            },
            "description": "Sends a password-reset email. Rate limit: 20 / hour / IP."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset password",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"token-from-email\",\n  \"new_password\": \"newSecret123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/reset-password",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "reset-password"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Pickers (dropdowns)",
      "description": "Everything needed to populate the booking form — Site → Building → Floor → Facility cascade.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List sites",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/sites?page=1&limit=100",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "sites"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "100" },
                { "key": "q", "value": "", "disabled": true, "description": "Search by name/code/address" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List buildings",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/buildings?site_id={{site_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "buildings"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "site_id", "value": "{{site_id}}" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List floors",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/floors?site_id={{site_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "floors"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "site_id", "value": "{{site_id}}" },
                { "key": "building_id", "value": "", "disabled": true }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List facilities",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/facilities?page=1&limit=50&site_id={{site_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "facilities"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "50" },
                { "key": "site_id", "value": "{{site_id}}" },
                { "key": "floor_id", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "type", "value": "", "disabled": true, "description": "meeting_room | gym | conference_room | desk | swimming_pool | other" },
                { "key": "q", "value": "", "disabled": true, "description": "Search by facility name" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Facility detail",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/facilities/{{facility_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "facilities", "{{facility_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Returns capacity, type, approval rules, chair layout, operating hours — everything needed on the facility detail screen."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Facility operating hours",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/facilities/{{facility_id}}/hours",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "facilities", "{{facility_id}}", "hours"]
            },
            "description": "Returns rows per weekday with open/close/slot_minutes. day_of_week: 0=Sun..6=Sat."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Bookings",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List bookings",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/bookings?page=1&limit=20&scope=mine&from_date={{today}}&to_date={{tomorrow}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "bookings"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "scope", "value": "mine", "description": "mine | tenant | team" },
                { "key": "from_date", "value": "{{today}}", "description": "Inclusive. Format YYYY-MM-DD" },
                { "key": "to_date", "value": "{{tomorrow}}", "description": "EXCLUSIVE. Use next day to query 'today'" },
                { "key": "status", "value": "", "disabled": true, "description": "pending | approved | rejected | cancelled | completed" },
                { "key": "facility_id", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "q", "value": "", "disabled": true, "description": "Search title/facility/booker" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Paginated list. Each row includes facility_name, booker_name, department_name, status, times, attendee_count.\n\n⚠️ `to_date` is **exclusive**. For 'today only' use `from=today, to=tomorrow`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Day availability (all slots)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/bookings/day?facility_id={{facility_id}}&date={{today}}&attendees=1",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "bookings", "day"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "facility_id", "value": "{{facility_id}}" },
                { "key": "date", "value": "{{today}}", "description": "YYYY-MM-DD" },
                { "key": "attendees", "value": "1" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Use this instead of N parallel /check calls.** Returns availability for every slot of the day in one call.\n\nResponse:\n```json\n{\n  \"facility_id\": 86,\n  \"date\": \"2026-10-21\",\n  \"mode\": \"shared\",\n  \"capacity\": 28,\n  \"closed\": false,\n  \"slots\": [\n    { \"start\": \"09:00\", \"end\": \"09:30\", \"conflict\": false, \"seats_taken\": 0, \"seats_remaining\": 28 },\n    ...\n  ]\n}\n```"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Check single slot",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/bookings/check?facility_id={{facility_id}}&start_at=2026-10-22 10:00:00&end_at=2026-10-22 11:00:00&attendees=1",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "bookings", "check"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "facility_id", "value": "{{facility_id}}" },
                { "key": "start_at", "value": "2026-10-22 10:00:00" },
                { "key": "end_at", "value": "2026-10-22 11:00:00" },
                { "key": "attendees", "value": "1" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns `{ conflict, mode, capacity, seats_taken, seats_remaining, occupied_desks }`. Use for one-off pre-flight check (prefer `/day` for a full picker)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create booking",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"facility_id\": {{facility_id}},\n  \"title\": \"Design review\",\n  \"start_at\": \"2026-10-22 10:00:00\",\n  \"end_at\":   \"2026-10-22 11:00:00\",\n  \"department_id\": null,\n  \"remarks\": \"Monthly sync\",\n  \"repeat_type\": \"none\",\n  \"dont_disturb\": 0,\n  \"guests\": [],\n  \"meals\": [],\n  \"desk_ids\": []\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/bookings",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "bookings"]
            },
            "description": "Creates a booking. Returns `{ id, status }` where status is `approved` or `pending` (if facility requires approval).\n\n**Required:** facility_id, title, start_at, end_at.\n**Optional:** department_id, remarks, repeat_type (none/daily/weekly/monthly), guests[], meals[] (meal_time IDs), desk_ids[] (chair IDs from facility layout).\n\nCommon errors:\n- 422 'Start time must be in the future.'\n- 409 'This slot is already booked'\n- 409 'This facility has N bookable seat(s). You are trying to book M…'\n- 422 'Facility is closed at that time' (operating-hours violation)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get booking detail",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/bookings/{{booking_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "bookings", "{{booking_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Full detail incl. guests[], meals[], approvals[]."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cancel booking",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/bookings/{{booking_id}}/cancel",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "bookings", "{{booking_id}}", "cancel"]
            },
            "description": "No body. Rules:\n- Past bookings can't be cancelled\n- Users can only cancel their own bookings (super_admin can force)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reschedule (via mail token)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"signed-token-from-email\",\n  \"start_at\": \"2026-10-23 10:00:00\",\n  \"end_at\":   \"2026-10-23 11:00:00\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/bookings/{{booking_id}}/reschedule",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "bookings", "{{booking_id}}", "reschedule"]
            },
            "description": "Used when user clicks a 'Reschedule' link from a booking email."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
